# Vita SMOKE VM only — ttys on which root may log in. The serial line (ttyS0) is what QEMU `-serial mon:stdio`
# uses; a minimal image's securetty omits it, which makes root login on serial loop back to `login:`. Listing it
# here (and hvc0 for virtio-console) lets root log in / auto-login on the console. Smoke/test only.
console
tty1
tty2
tty3
tty4
tty5
tty6
ttyS0
ttyS1
ttyAMA0
hvc0
